BEGIN_PGML Compare the probability of getting tails when flipping a coin once to the probability of drawing a single red card.
[`P(\text{tails}) =`][_]{Compute(1/2)}{10}; [`P(\text{red}) = `] [_]{Compute(1/2)}{10}. Difference: [_]{'0'}{10}
END_PGML
