BEGIN_PGML Compare the probability of getting two tails when flipping a coin twice to the probability of drawing two red cards (without replacement).
[`P(\text{2 tails}) =`][_]{Compute(1/4)}{10}; [`P(\text{2 reds}) = `] [_]{Compute((4*3)/(8*7))}{10}. Difference: [_]{Compute(1/28)}{10}
END_PGML
